46은 subprocess.Popen을 사용하고, scripts/execute.py:301-328의 _invoke_codex는 run_codex_process만 호출한다. subprocess.run은 timeout의 Windows taskkill 경로인 scripts/execute.py:53에서만 사용된다. python -m pytest scripts/test_execute.py -q 결과는 8 failed, 50 passed이며 invocation 6건이 subprocess.run mock의 call_args 부재 또는 Popen 실패로 재현됐다.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"현재 Windows 실행에서는 4건이 TypeError(call_args=None), PATHEXT 관련 2건이 WinError 2였지만 공통 원인은 테스트가 패치한 subprocess.run을 _invoke_codex가 거치지 않는 것이다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"artifact-rename-deliberate\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"scripts/execute.py:345-347은 step{N}-invoke.json을 기록한다. phase 13의 c709c22 diff는 기존 step{N}-output.json을 invoke.json과 stdout/stderr 로그로 바꾼 의도를 보인다. scripts/execute_test.py:192-201은 invoke.json 존재와 output.json 부재를 고정하며, 이 스위트는 14 tests OK였다. 구식 기대는 scripts/test_execute.py:497-498의 step2-output.json이다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"guardrails-root-moved\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"scripts/execute.py:118-123이 self._root_path를 초기화하고 scripts/execute.py:243-249가 이를 사용한다. scripts/test_execute.py:184-193은 __new__로 __init__을 건너뛰므로 line 192에서 AttributeError를 재현했다. 반대로 실제 StepExecutor(root=임시 프로젝트) 인스턴스는 동일한 빈 프로젝트에서 _load_guardrails() == ''을 반환했다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"contracts-still-hold\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"codex exec: scripts/execute.py:321; --json: line 322; --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox: line 321; --dangerously-bypass-hook-trust: line 322; shutil.which('codex')와 실패 시 bare codex: lines 317-317; stdin prompt와 trailing '-': lines 309-323 및 run_codex_process lines 32,49; timeout 1800: line 326.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"ci-runs-neither\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"정확한 pytest 실행은 .github/workflows/ci.yml:90, review.yml:185, oncall.yml:235의 scripts/test_review_verdict.py -q뿐이다. package.json:19의 test:ci-scripts는 bash/node 테스트만 호출하고 test_execute.py·execute_test.py·test_stop_verify.py를 호출하지 않는다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"sibling-suites-green\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"실행 결과: scripts/test_dangerous_command_guard.py 13 passed; scripts/test_tdd_guard.py 13 passed; scripts/test_review_verdict.py 21 passed; scripts/execute_test.py 14 tests OK; scripts/test_stop_verify.py 6 passed, 2 failed. stop_verify 실패는 test_failure_emits_block_json 및 test_failure_reason_carries_npm_output이다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"stop-verify-guard-is-deliberate\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"scripts/hooks/stop-verify.sh:25-29 주석과 가드가 CI 또는 node_modules 부재 시 exit 0을 의도한다: CI 검증을 걸지 않는 이유를 리뷰·트리아지 체크아웃의 node_modules 부재와 exit 127, PR #5 재현으로 명시한다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"vacuous-passers\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"stop-verify.sh의 실제 OUTPUT 실행문을 검증 중 INTENTIONAL_VACUOUS_PASS_MUTATION으로 바꾼 뒤 python -m pytest scripts/test_stop_verify.py -q -k 'test_success_emits_nothing or test_stdout_never_leaks_plain_text'는 2 passed, 6 deselected였다. 두 테스트가 node_modules 조기 종료를 지나지 않아 망가진 본문을 감지하지 못했다. 변형은 원복했고 hook의 내용 diff는 없다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"linux-portability\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"scripts/execute_test.py:27-35의 tasklist와 :50-55의 taskkill은 os.name == 'nt' 분기 안에만 있고 Linux 경로는 os.kill/os.killpg를 사용한다. WSL Ubuntu-22.04에서 python3 scripts/execute_test.py는 14 tests OK였다. scripts/test_execute.py의 Windows 전용 하드코딩은 :440-445의 C:\\\\Users\\\\x...\\\\codex.CMD 1건이며 현재 Popen 구현에서는 Linux에서 실행할 수 없다.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"WSL에는 pytest가 설치되어 있지 않아 pytest 기반 Linux 교차 실행은 하지 못했다. CI 연결 시 execute_test.py는 Linux에서 실행 가능하고, Windows 절대경로 테스트는 step 1에서 portable mock으로 고쳐야 한다.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"linux_incompatible_tests\": [\r\n    \"scripts/test_execute.py::TestInvokeCodex::test_resolves_executable_through_pathext\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"verdict\": \"upheld\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nstep1-report:\r\n{\r\n  \"phase\": \"32-harness-test-rot\",\r\n  \"step\": 1,\r\n  \"name\": \"repair-rotted-tests\",\r\n  \"scope_note\": \"The repair set is 8 tests in test_execute.py plus 4 tests in test_stop_verify.py; all 12 are listed here.\",\r\n  \"changes\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_invokes_codex_with_correct_args\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Patched subprocess.run, which is not the Codex invocation path.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Patches execute.run_codex_process and inspects the command argv directly.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Replaced --json with --mutated-json in execute.py.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: AssertionError: assert '--json' in cmd\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_resolves_executable_through_pathext\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Expected a subprocess.run call and therefore did not observe the Popen-backed path.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Patches run_codex_process and verifies shutil.which('codex') and the resolved executable in argv.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Removed the shutil.which result and forced the bare codex name.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: Expected 'which' to be called once. Called 0 times.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_falls_back_to_bare_name_when_not_resolvable\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Patched subprocess.run and asserted against a call that no longer occurs.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Patches run_codex_process and verifies the bare codex fallback in argv.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed the fallback from codex to mutated-codex.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 'mutated-codex' == 'codex'\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_hooks_are_not_skipped\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Patched subprocess.run instead of the current process wrapper.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Patches run_codex_process and verifies --dangerously-bypass-hook-trust in argv.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Replaced --dangerously-bypass-hook-trust with --mutated-hook-trust.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: AssertionError: assert '--dangerously-bypass-hook-trust' in cmd\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_prompt_goes_through_stdin\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Read input from subprocess.run kwargs, although the wrapper uses communicate(input=...).\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Verifies the final '-' argv marker and the prompt positional argument passed to run_codex_process.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed the final '-' argv marker to --prompt.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: AssertionError: assert '--prompt' == '-'\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_saves_invoke_metadata\",\r\n      \"before\": \"test_saves_output_json expected the removed step2-output.json artifact.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Reads step2-invoke.json and retains the non-overlapping step, name, and exitCode checks. InvokeArtifactTests owns the artifact filename and legacy-output absence checks.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed execute.py to write step{N}-output.json instead of step{N}-invoke.json.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: FileNotFoundError for step2-invoke.json\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestLoadGuardrails.test_empty_project\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Used StepExecutor.__new__, so _load_guardrails could not access the initialized root path.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Creates a real StepExecutor('dummy', root=tmp_path) against an empty temporary project and preserves the empty-string assertion.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed the empty guardrail return from an empty string to mutated guardrails.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 'mutated guardrails' == ''\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestInvokeCodex.test_timeout_is_1800\",\r\n      \"before\": \"Asserted a timeout kwarg on subprocess.run, which no longer owns the timeout.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"Asserts positional timeout argument 1800 on run_codex_process.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed the timeout argument passed to run_codex_process from 1800 to 1799.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 1799 == 1800\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestVerification.test_success_emits_nothing\",\r\n      \"before\": \"The temporary project had no node_modules, so the hook exited before validation.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"The project fixture creates node_modules and write_package_json supplies lint, typecheck, build, and test scripts; the success path is exercised.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Added broken success output before the hook's successful exit.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 'broken success output' == ''\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestVerification.test_failure_emits_block_json\",\r\n      \"before\": \"The missing dependency/script precondition caused early exit instead of block JSON.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"The real validation path runs and the existing decision == block assertion is preserved.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Changed the failure decision JSON from block to allow.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 'allow' == 'block'\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestVerification.test_failure_reason_carries_npm_output\",\r\n      \"before\": \"The test did not reach npm output collection because the dependency guard exited first.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"The fixture reaches npm, and the existing LINT_OUTPUT_MARKER assertion remains unchanged.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Replaced the captured failure tail with mutated failure output.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: assert 'LINT_OUTPUT_MARKER' in reason\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"test\": \"TestVerification.test_stdout_never_leaks_plain_text\",\r\n      \"before\": \"The empty stdout assertion could pass solely because of the dependency guard's early exit.\",\r\n      \"after\": \"The fixture reaches the successful hook path and still rejects non-JSON stdout if any is emitted.\",\r\n      \"mutation\": \"Added plain text to the successful hook path.\",\r\n      \"mutation_result\": \"failed as expected: JSONDecodeError: Expecting value\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"removed_assertions\": [],\r\n  \"verification\": {\r\n    \"mutation_runs\": \"All 12 listed repaired contracts were exercised with an intentional mutation where applicable; every mutation failed its target test, and every mutation was reverted.\",\r\n    \"pytest_scripts\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"python -m pytest scripts/ -q\",\r\n      \"result\": \"127 passed in 22.98s\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"npm_test\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"npm run test\",\r\n      \"result\": \"85 test files passed; 1602 tests passed\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"typescript\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"npx tsc --noEmit\",\r\n      \"result\": \"passed\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"lint\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"npm run lint\",\r\n      \"result\": \"passed with 0 errors and 1 pre-existing warning in src/app/api/oncall/alert/route.test.ts\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
